      "constructor": "__LENS_FLARE_SWITCH_COLLISION__",
      "area_mask": "0x000041F1001A0000",
      "notes": "Lens flare enable/disable switch. This object triggers when the local player is within 20 units, and sets a\nglobal which determines whether objects of type 0x001E (__LENS_FLARE__) should render anything. Params:\nparam1 = if > 0, enable lens flare rendering; if <= 0, disable it\nThis object isn't constructed in split-screen mode.",
